{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What if your Poker hand could save the world? \u2014\u00a0</strong><i>Are you ready to bet a billion souls on a single hand?</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Eternal Dreams - A Poker-based Roguelite RPG </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In\u00a0<i>Eternal Dreams</i>, nightmares are real, and the only way to defeat them is with a deck of enchanted poker cards.\u00a0 Assemble a party of unique heroes, build a powerful deck that synergies with your team, and conquer the forces of darkness. Every hand you play determines the fate of reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038720/extras/5a3eecc7ef42a33a8b60472a79abae2d.webp?t=1762344779\" width=388 height=32 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNIQUE POKER-BASED BATTLE SYSTEM -\u00a0</strong>Combine the strategy of Poker with the depth of a full RPG.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ENDLESS REPLAYABILITY -\u00a0</strong>Explore 13 chapters filled with over 200 unique enemies and challenging bosses in a roguelite adventure where no two dreams are the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEEP CUSTOMIZATION -</strong>\u00a0Collect and upgrade dozens of &quot;Battle Mods&quot;, weapons, and unique hero skills to create your ultimate dream team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INFINITE STRATEGIES</strong>\u00a0- Customize your battle deck with different Poker cards and upgrades that synergize with your &quot;Battle Mods&quot;, gears, heroes and skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RICH AND MYSTERIOUS WORLD -</strong>\u00a0Explore and uncover the secrets of the Eternal Dreams with unique battles and special encounters.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Add to your WISHLIST</strong> using the green button above to be t